{"type":"json_object","message":"Net change in net revenue is the 2003 net revenue minus the 2002 net revenue, both from the comparative table in millions. I use t4c1n0 = 426.6 for 2003 net revenue and t1c1n0 = 380.2 for 2002 net revenue.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"426.6 - 380.2","variables":{"rev2003":{"value":426.6,"source":"source:t4c1n0","unit":"$ in millions"},"rev2002":{"value":380.2,"source":"source:t1c1n0","unit":"$ in millions"}},"sources":{"rev2003":"source:t4c1n0","rev2002":"source:t1c1n0"}}}